    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture at consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has shifted from a conceptual product thesis established in March 2026 to a set of empirical validations surfaced in late July. The core thesis posits that the product's primary differentiator is the ability to secure decision artifacts at the exact moment of consensus. By July 26, 2026, this abstract positioning was reinforced by [Sprint 4 proof points](narr:Position_Sprint4ProofPoints), which anchor the theory in specific operational outcomes. These include the successful [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785059979981_1), a record-setting [velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785059979981_2), and the identification of the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785059979981_3) as the critical technical unlock for the workflow.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785059979981_1> ;
